For chunk c, let `acc_c` be the running cumsum at the start of chunk c (i.e., the sum of all elements before the chunk).

For element j within chunk c:
- output[chunkStart + j] = acc_c + sum(input[chunkStart..chunkStart+j])
- In particular, the last element: output[chunkStart + chunkSize-1] = acc_c + sum(input[chunkStart..chunkStart+chunkSize-1])
